experience points, vitamins and minerals. Chalk this one up to getting
in over your head. 'L's are indeed vastly more dangerous, and one
of the worst genocideable nuisances in the game. ('h' being the other,
with 'R' a distant third. Some include ';' or 'n' but I find these
relatively easy to avoid.)

